0327-negroni-wlan-join-open: Wi-Fi, join a BSS as a station (open system) and the link life cycle.
negroni_wlan_join.c: associate/disassociate from the API mailbox, run on the driver thread: the strongest BSS
of the SSID (a scan first if needed), VDEV_START (20 MHz, HE20 channel mode), PEER_CREATE, AUTH and ASSOC REQ
by WMI_MGMT_TX_SEND (frame in a DMA slot, IOVA), PEER_ASSOC from the AP's rates/HT/WMM (ath11k
peer_assoc_prepare), VDEV_UP, DTIM policy, powersave off, PEER AUTHORIZE -> CONNECTED. Down on request,
deauth/disassoc, PEER_STA_KICKOUT, ROAM beacon miss or 10 s without a beacon: VDEV_DOWN, PEER_DELETE,
VDEV_STOP. Small DMA buffer helper. negroni_wlan_dp.c / negroni_wlan_wpa.c: placeholders for 0328 / 0329.
negroni_wlan_wmi.c: join events routed to the join code. Details: patches/xnu/README-wifi.md "0327".

