 /*
- * NEGRONI QCA6490 Wi-Fi: join, data path and WPA2 parts of the station manager.
- * 0326: placeholders, so the API (negroni_wlan_api.h) links and answers ENOTSUP. 0327 replaces this file.
+ * NEGRONI QCA6490 Wi-Fi (patch 0327): join a BSS as a station (open system authentication), the link
+ * life cycle and the API's associate / disassociate.
+ *
+ * Sequence (ath11k mac.c: assign_vif_chanctx -> vdev start, sta_state NOTEXIST->NONE -> peer create, mac80211
+ * auth/assoc frames -> WMI mgmt tx, bss_info_changed(assoc) -> ath11k_bss_assoc: peer assoc + vdev up):
+ *   1. the strongest BSS with the SSID from the scan list (a passive scan first if none was seen in 60 s)
+ *   2. WMI_PEER_CREATE (the AP; WCN6855 vdev_start_delay: the peer before the vdev start), 0328: HTT peer map
+ *   3. WMI_VDEV_START on its channel, 20 MHz (channel mode HE20 as ath11k_phymodes), wait VDEV_START_RESP
+ *   4. AUTH (open, seq 1) by WMI_MGMT_TX_SEND, wait AUTH seq 2 status 0 (3 tries, 500 ms each)
+ *   5. ASSOC REQ (ESS, rates as the AP's, HT capabilities 20 MHz, WMM info if the AP has WMM, RSN from 0329),
+ *      wait ASSOC RESP status 0 + AID (3 tries)
+ *   6. WMI_PEER_ASSOC (legacy + HT rates and caps from the AP's elements, ath11k_peer_assoc_prepare), wait
+ *      PEER_ASSOC_CONF; WMI_VDEV_UP (AID, BSSID); VDEV_PARAM DTIM_POLICY stick; STA powersave off
+ *   7. open: PEER_SET_PARAM AUTHORIZE 1 -> CONNECTED. WPA2 (0329): HANDSHAKE, keys, then AUTHORIZE.
+ * Down (request, deauth/disassoc from the AP, PEER_STA_KICKOUT, ROAM BMISS, 10 s without a beacon): DEAUTH
+ * frame (our request only), VDEV_DOWN, VDEV_STOP, PEER_DELETE -> IDLE + NWLAN_EV_LINK_DOWN. A join that ends before
+ * JOINING (no BSS, wrong security) also sends NWLAN_EV_LINK_DOWN with last_error.
+ *
+ * Management frames go out by WMI with the frame in a DMA buffer (IOVA via negroni_wlan_dma_map) and its first
+ * 64 bytes inline (wmi.c ath11k_wmi_mgmt_send). UNTESTED ON HARDWARE.
  */
